' --- defects ---
note bottom of CApi
  <b>ApiService contract gaps</b>
  * get() ignores its own
    useCacheOnlyOnError param
  * cache hit synthesises a 200 with
    header x-cached-response:true —
    never inspected by any service
  * get/post throw localized
    <i>Strings</i>, delete/patch/put
    rethrow raw errors
  * 3 overlapping namespaces for the
    same order-status change
end note

note bottom of CNotch
  <b>.env.example BUG</b>
  NOTCHPAY_CALLBACK_URL=${APP_URL}/api/v1/
  subscriptions/notchpay/callback
  <b>that URI does not exist</b> —
  live route is /api/subscriptions/
  notchpay/callback
end note

note bottom of CCallSvc
  <b>No media stack.</b>
  Inbound calls arrive by FCM only.
  Outbound ring = POST
  conversations/{id}/call.
  There is no WebRTC/SDP anywhere.
end note

note bottom of IMobile
  <b>Unthrottled.</b> statefulApi() and
  throttleApi() are absent from
  bootstrap/app.php, so the api group
  resolves to SubstituteBindings only
  across all 328 routes.
end note

@enduml
